WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
07:40 — Charge log. After an overnight charge Sophie logs kWh on her phone — a habit that beats guessing range on a Monday.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
12:00 — Reminder check. iPad reminders at lunch show MOT window thirty days out; the reminder beats the fine, every time.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
19:00 — MOT docs. Laptop document pack holds MOT and insurance; she finds the PDF in seconds, not in email search limbo.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
19:40 — Garage. Garage on the laptop is one calm overview — EV and reminders in one place.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
20:00 — Phone. Phone Today confirms tomorrow’s charge window. She locks the screen without a paperwork spike.

